 the Praiseworthy,","j":30,"h":59,"s":85,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"85:9","t":"To whom belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth. And Allāh, over all things, is Witness.","j":30,"h":59,"s":85,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"85:10","t":"Indeed, those who have tortured the believing men and believing women and then have not repented will have the punishment of Hell, and they will have the punishment of the Burning Fire.","j":30,"h":59,"s":85,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"85:11","t":"Indeed, those who have believed and done righteous deeds will have gardens beneath which rivers flow. That is the great attainment.","j":30,"h":59,"s":85,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"85:12","t":"Indeed, the assault [i.e., vengeance] of your Lord is severe.","j":30,"h":59,"s":85,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"85:13","t":"Indeed, it is He who originates [creation] and repeats.","j":30,"h":59,"s":85,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"85:14","t":"And He is the Forgiving, the Affectionate,","j":30,"h":59,"s":85,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"85:15","t":"Honorable Owner of the Throne,","j":30,"h":59,"s":85,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"85:16","t":"Effecter of what He intends.","j":30,"h":59,"s":85,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"85:17","t":"Has there reached you the story of the soldiers -","j":30,"h":59,"s":85,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"85:18","t":"[Those of] Pharaoh and Thamūd?","j":30,"h":59,"s":85,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"85:19","t":"But they who disbelieve are in [persistent] denial,","j":30,"h":59,"s":85,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"85:20","t":"While Allāh encompasses them from behind.","j":30,"h":59,"s":85,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"85:21","t":"But this is an honored Qur’ān","j":30,"h":59,"s":85,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"85:22","t":"[Inscribed] in a Preserved Slate.","j":30,"h":59,"s":85,"a":22,"sd":null}],"juz":30,"hizb":59,"surahs":[84,85],"sajdah":false}